  "name": "Egg white and black bean breakfast bowl",
  "description": "Soft-set egg whites folded through black beans, rice and red bell pepper with salsa and spinach, in fifteen minutes.",
  "iconKey": "bowl",
  "instructions": [
    "Chop the bell pepper, then drain and rinse the black beans.",
    "Warm the olive oil in a skillet over medium heat, add the bell pepper and cook for 3 minutes.",
